                <note rend="inline" type="source">815.00/2400: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Vice Consul at Puerto Cortez</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Alexander</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-08-10T16:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">August 10,
                                1922—4 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Your August 8, 4 p.m.</p>
                <p>Department understands U.S.S. <hi rendition="#italic">Galveston</hi> will arrive
                    in two or three days.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
